# lib/ Conventions

## Parallelism (joblib)
- Always `joblib.Parallel(n_jobs, verbose=int(verbose))` + `delayed()`
- Split inputs: `np.array_split(times, nprocs)` before dispatch
- Single-job guard: `if n_jobs <= 1: result = [func(...)]`

## Verbose / Stderr
- Every pipeline function: `verbose: bool` param
- `print("...", file=stderr)` guarded by `if verbose:`

## PathConfigManager
- `from .paths import PathConfigManager` — all paths from `lib/paths.py`
- Never hardcode output dirs; use `p.create_directories()`

## Spatial Joins
- `NearestNeighbors(metric="haversine")` — inputs radians, lat-first
- `coords = np.deg2rad(np.hstack([lats.reshape(-1,1), lons.reshape(-1,1)]))`

## Label / Column Conventions
- Labels: `"positive"`, `"negative"`, `"unlabelled"` in `"label"` column
- Coords: `"lon"`, `"lat"`, `"age (Ma)"` — exact strings
- Use `lib/misc.py:load_data()` for all CSV/DataFrame inputs

## Plate Models
- `lib/plate_models.py:get_plate_reconstruction(model_name, model_dir)` — PMM + local fallback
- Hold `_TemporaryFileWrapper` returned when `filter_topologies=True`
